Third-party code distributed with this package
----------------------------------------------

`libs/flecs` is a verbatim copy of flecs, vendored rather than fetched (see
UPSTREAM.md). It is not covered by the copyright above. flecs is distributed
under its own MIT licence:

    Copyright (c) 2025 Sander Mertens

    Portions Copyright (c) Meta Platforms, Inc. and affiliates

The full text ships with this package as `libs/flecs/LICENSE`, and the second
line of it is the reason this notice exists: flecs carries a contribution whose
copyright is not its author's, and a licence file that named only him would be
an incomplete notice for the bytes in this repository.
